{"code":"N16","wikidata":"Q96096780","wikipedia":{"en":"11th Infantry Regiment BTS station","th":"สถานีกรมทหารราบที่ 11"},"summary":{"en":"11th Infantry Regiment Station is a BTS Skytrain station, on the Sukhumvit Line in Bangkok, Thailand. It is located in front of the headquarters of the 11th Infantry Regiment of the Royal Thai Army. The station is part of the northern extension of the Sukhumvit Line and opened on 5 June 2020, as part of phase 3.","th":"สถานีกรมทหารราบที่ 11 เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าบีทีเอสแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสุขุมวิท ยกระดับเหนือถนนพหลโยธินในพื้นที่เขตบางเขน กรุงเทพมหานคร เปิดให้บริการเมื่อวันที่ 5 มิถุนายน พ.ศ."},"opened":"2020-06-05","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/BTS_11th_Infantry_Regiment_-_Station.jpg/960px-BTS_11th_Infantry_Regiment_-_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:BTS_11th_Infantry_Regiment_-_Station.jpg","author":"Rachasak Ragkamnerd","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/BTS_11th_Infantry_Regiment_-_Bangkhen_bus_depot_U-Turn.jpg/960px-BTS_11th_Infantry_Regiment_-_Bangkhen_bus_depot_U-Turn.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:BTS_11th_Infantry_Regiment_-_Bangkhen_bus_depot_U-Turn.jpg","author":"Rachasak Ragkamnerd","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/BTS_11th_Infantry_Regiment_-_Bangkhen_bus_depot.jpg/960px-BTS_11th_Infantry_Regiment_-_Bangkhen_bus_depot.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:BTS_11th_Infantry_Regiment_-_Bangkhen_bus_depot.jpg","author":"Rachasak Ragkamnerd","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/BTS_11th_Infantry_Regiment_-_Entranc